      "message": "Fix stale media 404 and heading/landmark semantics on exported pages\n\n- Remove the export's placeholder api/media.php?name=... images, which\n  404'd on static GitHub Pages (no PHP endpoint) on 12 pages.\n- Demote the extra <h1> section headings to <h2> so each page has a single\n  level-1 heading, pinning the original size via indica-h1-size so the\n  rendered design is unchanged at every breakpoint.\n- Mark the exported navbar div as a navigation landmark (role=navigation).\n- Extend fix-pages.mjs with the three steps (idempotent) and document them.",
